# Reign Of Terror Game Program Audit Report

## Overview

This folder contains a historical public program audit report completed by Softstack for Reign Of Terror.

Reign Of Terror is included in Softstack’s public audit archive as a Web3 gaming program security reference.

## Audit Information

Project: Reign Of Terror  
Audit type: Game program audit  
Repository category: Historical public audit archive  
Public report status: Available in this folder  
Project status: Public activity may have changed after audit completion  

## Public Audit Report

[Program_Audit_ReignOfTerror_Game.pdf](./Program_Audit_ReignOfTerror_Game.pdf)

## Why This Folder Exists

This folder is preserved as part of Softstack’s public audit archive. It provides historical proof of completed security work for Web3 gaming infrastructure.

## Summary

This folder is a historical reference for Softstack’s program audit work connected to Web3 gaming, game logic and blockchain application security.

Softstack is a Germany based Web3 security firm founded in 2017, trusted for smart contract audits, blockchain security reviews, Web3 penetration testing and digital asset risk assessments.

Learn more about Softstack smart contract audits: https://softstack.io/smart-contract-audit/
